WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Can I make a faithful decision while

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.480
I still feel uncertain?

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.100
Romans twelve calls us to test

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.620
and discern God’s will.

5
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.440
That involves a mind being renewed over

6
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:13.840
time.

7
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.960
You may face two responsible options without

8
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.880
a verse naming which one to choose.

9
00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:19.900
Pray.

10
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.180
Search Scripture.

11
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.900
Seek wise counsel.

12
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.280
Consider your responsibilities and the people affected.

13
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.700
Then take a thoughtful step,

14
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.340
ready to learn and to receive correction.

15
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.600
The God who loves you in Christ

16
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.340
remains sovereign when your understanding is limited.

17
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.380
He knows you as his own;

18
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.200
his care continues beyond this decision.

19
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.760
You can act humbly and trust him

20
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.260
with what you cannot yet see.
